---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '外国人如何在中国使用滴滴';
const description = 'Set up and use DiDi (China\'s Uber) without a Chinese phone number. Ride options, payment, and tips.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/transport/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Transport
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🚗 网约车</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Use Didi in China as a Foreigner
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在没有中国电话号码的情况下设置和使用滴滴（中国的优步）。乘车选项、付款和小费。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        You can use DiDi <strong>没有中国电话号码</strong>. The easiest way is through the Alipay or WeChat mini-program — open the app, search for DiDi, and book a ride. Payment goes through Alipay/WeChat automatically. The standalone DiDi app also has an English version.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#alipay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📱 方法1：通过支付宝或微信（最简单）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#app" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📲 方法二：下载滴滴应用</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rides" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚘 骑行类型</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tips" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💡 使用DiDi的提示</a></li>
        <li><a href="#uber" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔀 优步怎么办？</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <h2 id="alipay" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📱 方法1：通过支付宝或微信（最简单）</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">If you already have Alipay set up (see the <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">支付宝设置指南</a>):</p>

      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li>打开支付宝或微信</li>
        <li>向下滚动到“小程序”（或搜索“滴滴”）</li>
        <li>点击DiDi小程序</li>
        <li>允许访问位置</li>
        <li>设置您的接送和目的地，选择乘车类型，然后确认。</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">（必填）：下载，用您的国际号码注册，链接您的Visa/Mastercard</div>
          <img src="/images/didi/alipay-didi.jpg" alt="Accessing DiDi through Alipay mini program" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mt-2">在支付宝的小程序列表中查找滴滴</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">WeChat</div>
          <img src="/images/didi/wechat-didi.jpg" alt="Accessing DiDi through WeChat mini program" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mt-2">在微信小程序中搜索滴滴</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">支付通过支付宝或微信自动完成。不需要中国电话号码。</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="app" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📲 方法二：下载滴滴应用</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">DiDi应用程序有英文版本。从您的应用商店下载（搜索“滴滴骑士”）。您可以使用国际电话号码注册，并在设置中将界面切换到英语。</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">付款方式：支付宝、微信支付、Visa/Mastercard（附加应用程序）。</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="rides" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🚘 骑行类型</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>快车：</strong> Standard ride, cheapest. Comparable to UberX.</li>
        <li><strong>总理：</strong> Slightly nicer cars, a bit more expensive.</li>
        <li><strong>出租车：</strong> Hails a regular taxi through the app. Pay the meter rate digitally.</li>
        <li><strong>豪华（豪华车）：</strong> High-end cars (Mercedes, BMW). Expensive.</li>
        <li><strong>租车：</strong> Book a driver for multiple hours or a full day.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="tips" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">💡 使用DiDi的提示</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>准确设置您的取件：</strong> Drag the pin on the map to exactly where you're standing. Drivers often can't find you if the pin is off.</li>
        <li><strong>检查车牌：</strong> Match the plate number in the app to the car.</li>
        <li><strong>使用应用内聊天：</strong> It has built-in translation for communicating with your driver.</li>
        <li><strong>耐心点：</strong> In busy areas, your driver might be a few minutes away.</li>
        <li><strong>收费：</strong> Highway tolls and airport fees are added to your fare automatically.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="uber" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🔀 优步怎么办？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">优步于2016年将其中国业务出售给滴滴。优步应用程序仍在中国运行，但仅适用于国际旅行者，司机可用性有限。滴滴是默认的叫车服务——你会得到更快的接送和更好的覆盖。</p>

    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何环游中国</strong> — the complete transport guide</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/airport-to-city/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🛬 <strong>从机场到城市</strong> — getting to your hotel</a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">💳 <strong>外国人如何设置支付宝</strong> — pay for DiDi rides</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.didiglobal.com/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">滴滴应用下载</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>